    "detailed_description": "Create your own political party, lace up your boxing gloves, and punch your way to the White House in Election Year Knockout! In a country torn apart by its political divide, the nation has resorted to boxing to settle its differences. Fight your way through hilarious political opponents from both sides of the aisle before squaring off with president Donald Thump himself!<br><br><strong>Game Features</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1313310/extras/5d6ef53f607227ca45b1505d7218e71d.poster.avif?t=1748190481\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1313310/extras/5d6ef53f607227ca45b1505d7218e71d.webm?t=1748190481\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1313310/extras/5d6ef53f607227ca45b1505d7218e71d.mp4?t=1748190481\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>Beat them all and become president!</strong><br>Fight political parody figures including Jab Bush, Uncle Joe, and Birdie Sanders.  Maybe you even have what it takes to reach the White House and take on the leader of the nation, Donald Thump! Each opponent presents a unique challenge with his/her own strengths and weaknesses. <br> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1313310/extras/6b3ebf85c3ddfe5932310b156207f4e9.poster.avif?t=1748190481\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1313310/extras/6b3ebf85c3ddfe5932310b156207f4e9.webm?t=1748190481\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1313310/extras/6b3ebf85c3ddfe5932310b156207f4e9.mp4?t=1748190481\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>Absolutely hilarious</strong><br>Hysterically funny cut scenes and political jokes are mixed in everywhere. You\u2019ll never laugh harder at a boxing game!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1313310/extras/a1bfc9ebd2824e415b1e6e32b2a37846.poster.avif?t=1748190481\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1313310/extras/a1bfc9ebd2824e415b1e6e32b2a37846.webm?t=1748190481\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1313310/extras/a1bfc9ebd2824e415b1e6e32b2a37846.mp4?t=1748190481\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>Customize your fighter</strong><br>Customize your fighter including the gender, hairstyle, skin tone, and hair color. There are even multiple patriotic styles of boxing attire to choose from with much more on the way soon!<br><br><strong>Dozens of challenging bonus missions</strong><br>The game doesn\u2019t end after beating an opponent in the ring. Optional bonus missions will keep political pugilists interested for hours.  Can you beat Jab Bush with a single punch or counter Donald Thump\u2019s Stormy Smash with a haymaker three times in a single round?<br><br><strong>Full controller support</strong><br>Plug in a supported controller (including Xbox One and PS4 controllers) for an even more authentic retro boxing game experience.",
    "about_the_game": "Create your own political party, lace up your boxing gloves, and punch your way to the White House in Election Year Knockout! In a country torn apart by its political divide, the nation has resorted to boxing to settle its differences. Fight your way through hilarious political opponents from both sides of the aisle before squaring off with president Donald Thump himself!<br><br><strong>Game Features</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1313310/extras/5d6ef53f607227ca45b1505d7218e71d.poster.avif?t=1748190481\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1313310/extras/5d6ef53f607227ca45b1505d7218e71d.webm?t=1748190481\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1313310/extras/5d6ef53f607227ca45b1505d7218e71d.mp4?t=1748190481\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>Beat them all and become president!</strong><br>Fight political parody figures including Jab Bush, Uncle Joe, and Birdie Sanders.  Maybe you even have what it takes to reach the White House and take on the leader of the nation, Donald Thump! Each opponent presents a unique challenge with his/her own strengths and weaknesses. <br> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1313310/extras/6b3ebf85c3ddfe5932310b156207f4e9.poster.avif?t=1748190481\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1313310/extras/6b3ebf85c3ddfe5932310b156207f4e9.webm?t=1748190481\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1313310/extras/6b3ebf85c3ddfe5932310b156207f4e9.mp4?t=1748190481\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>Absolutely hilarious</strong><br>Hysterically funny cut scenes and political jokes are mixed in everywhere. You\u2019ll never laugh harder at a boxing game!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1313310/extras/a1bfc9ebd2824e415b1e6e32b2a37846.poster.avif?t=1748190481\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1313310/extras/a1bfc9ebd2824e415b1e6e32b2a37846.webm?t=1748190481\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1313310/extras/a1bfc9ebd2824e415b1e6e32b2a37846.mp4?t=1748190481\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>Customize your fighter</strong><br>Customize your fighter including the gender, hairstyle, skin tone, and hair color. There are even multiple patriotic styles of boxing attire to choose from with much more on the way soon!<br><br><strong>Dozens of challenging bonus missions</strong><br>The game doesn\u2019t end after beating an opponent in the ring. Optional bonus missions will keep political pugilists interested for hours.  Can you beat Jab Bush with a single punch or counter Donald Thump\u2019s Stormy Smash with a haymaker three times in a single round?<br><br><strong>Full controller support</strong><br>Plug in a supported controller (including Xbox One and PS4 controllers) for an even more authentic retro boxing game experience.",
    "short_description": "Become President in this hilarious Punch-Out-inspired political sim where all laws have been replaced with boxing! Each opponent has unique tactics and special moves to test your skill and strategy on your way to the White House! Form your own third party and hit the campaign trail. Literally.",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Portugal, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Traditional Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
    "reviews": "\u201cElection Year Knockout is a boxing game that wears its Mike Tyson\u2019s Punch-Out!! influence on its sleeve.\u201d<br>Hardcore Gamer<br><br>\u201cWhat really surprised me was how much depth and polish this game has. Not to mention, the writing is really witty and actually had me laughing out loud quite a few times. The developer did an \u201cexceptionull\u201d job on this game. (Sorry. I had to do it.) It sheds light on an otherwise dark topic for people and just has fun with it. I honestly can\u2019t recommend Election Year Knockout enough.\u201d<br>SNAPP Attack!<br><br>\u201cWhile the initial pitch might inspire the odd eye roll, I was pleasantly surprised to find that Knockout looks to be a polished, suitably ridiculous arcade boxing game.\u201d<br>Pocket Gamer<br>",
