        "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows FBI Edition<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> A fast one. No one's ever seen a processor this fast.<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> The most beautiful graphics, that's what people tell me.<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> One of those speaker systems I use at rallies. Sit right in front so you don't miss anything.<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Jab's banned, don't let him in. Okay? He doesn't get to play.</li></ul>"
